    "name": "Bladebearer: Recarved",
    "steam_appid": 3574540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/extras/825f9703f5320e14b7e72876b044c693.avif?t=1754864966\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE THE BLADE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve through the battlefield, defeating peasants, knights, and others in rhythm-game-like combat. Maneuver yourself to match blocks and counters. Uncover unique combos, and learn how to wield yourself in the hands of different warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAR THE WIELDER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swordsmen are disposable</i>; you are not. Experience the combat techniques and strength levels of different sword bearers. Use their lives to pursue your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES PLANNED FOR THE COMPLETED VERSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New endings</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574540/extras/825f9703f5320e14b7e72876b044c693.avif?t=1754864966\" width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE THE BLADE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve through the battlefield, defeating peasants, knights, and others in rhythm-game-like combat. Maneuver yourself to match blocks and counters. Uncover unique combos, and learn how to wield yourself in the hands of different warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAR THE WIELDER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swordsmen are disposable</i>; you are not. Experience the combat techniques and strength levels of different sword bearers. Use their lives to pursue your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES PLANNED FOR THE COMPLETED VERSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New endings</p></li></ul>",
